    <Major></Major>
    <Description>My keybinds are designed for aggressive shotgun fights while building. Mouse Button 5 is stairs, Q is pyramid, Z is wall, X is floor, and C is edit, allowing me to quickly structure and trap enemies. My shotgun is always in slot 2 so I can immediately switch and finish opponents during fights. This setup focuses on offensive building combined with fast shotgun engagement. I'll make fixes from time to time, but don't rely on this macro as it dosen't move your camera.

Good Luck!

:D</Description>
